      "en": "<h3 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">🎣 What to catch</h3>\n        <p><b>Equipment:</b> Float rod</p>\n        <p><b>Best baits:</b> Bread, dough</p>\n        <h3 style=\"margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:10px;\">🌊 Fishing conditions</h3>\n        <p><b>Swell:</b> Calm</p>\n        <p><b>Wind:</b> Any</p>\n        <p><b>Relief:</b> Harbors</p>\n        <h3 style=\"margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:10px;\">🕒 When and why</h3>\n        <p><b>Season:</b> All year</p>\n        <p><b>Time:</b> Day</p>\n        <p><b>Tide:</b> On the flood</p>\n        <p><b>Moon:</b> Any</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><b>Important:</b> Moves in schools.</p><br><br><b>💡 Tactics:</b> Surface fishing. Use bread chum. Mullet swims in schools. Keep the rod ready, bites are sudden.\n            <br><br>\n            <details class=\"exp-guide\" style=\"margin-top:15px; background:#f4f9fc; border:1px solid #cce5ff; border-radius:8px;\">\n                <summary style=\"cursor:pointer; font-weight:bold; color:#0056b3; padding:10px; background:#e6f2ff; border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\">🎣 Encyclopedia: Fishing Rig</summary>\n                <div class=\"details-content\" style=\"padding:15px; text-align:center;\">\n                    <div class=\"zoomable\" onclick=\"zoomImage(this)\" style=\"cursor:zoom-in;\">\n                        <img src=\"images/boia_correr_en.png\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:650px; border-radius:8px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" alt=\"fukase Rig\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-size:13px; color:#555;\">(Клик по картинке для увеличения)</p>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            ",
